{"pageProps":{"lesson":{"day":27,"title":"Day 27: Progress and next steps — SpeakSprint","heading":"Progress and next steps","kicker":"DAY 27 · 30 MINUTES · 6 SESSIONS / WEEK","description":"Báo cáo tiến độ và bước tiếp theo.","contentVersion":2,"answers":{"comp":"a|b|a","quiz":"a|b"},"sections":[{"id":"mission","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">MISSION · 1 MIN</span><h2>Today's mission</h2><p>Give a clear progress update and next steps. Speak for <b>120 seconds</b>, using at least <b>3 of today’s 5 chunks</b>. Say it first; write only brief notes.</p><p class=\"instruction\">5 chunk mỗi ngày · tối đa 5 chunk mới. Ngày tổng kết ôn lại chunk đã học.</p>"},{"id":"warmup","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Warm-up recall</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Recall before opening today’s chunk cards. Ôn theo mốc bài học +1, +3, +7, +14; mỗi lần chọn vài chunk để giữ bài gọn.</p><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 26 · ôn sau 1 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Describe a possible future result. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"It may take a few days for users to learn the new page.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 24 · ôn sau 3 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Share a lesson from a past experience. <small>Use it in a different project or situation.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We learned that we need to test earlier.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 20 · ôn sau 7 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Promise to verify information and reply. <small>Say two connected sentences aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I'll check and get back to you before our next meeting.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 13 · ôn sau 14 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Present an alternative solution. <small>Answer as if a colleague has just asked you.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Another option is to build a simpler service.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"reading","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">We've completed the main screens for the mobile app. So far, we've tested the login and payment pages. We're on track to release on Friday, but we still need to fix three small bugs. The next step is to test those changes and prepare the store description. Last week, we found that some instructions were unclear. We learned that short examples help, so we added them. I think the app will be easier to use now. Could you help me with one final check tomorrow? After that, I plan to send a short update to the product manager.</div>"},{"id":"comprehension","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"comp","label":"COMPREHENSION · 3 MIN","heading":"Check the message","hint":"Look for who, what happened, and why the speaker says it.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. What is the speaker reporting?","choices":[{"text":" Progress and remaining work","name":"comp-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp1"},{"text":" A canceled release","name":"comp-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp1"}]},{"prompt":"2. What still needs fixing?","choices":[{"text":" Every main screen","name":"comp-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp2"},{"text":" Three small bugs","name":"comp-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp2"}]},{"prompt":"3. Why ask for one final check?","choices":[{"text":" To verify the changes before release","name":"comp-3","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-comp3"},{"text":" To choose a new project","name":"comp-3","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-comp3"}]}]},{"id":"chunks","className":"panel","type":"chunks","label":"CHUNKS · 5 MIN","heading":"Five chunks to use today","instruction":"Learn the whole phrase. Change the details to fit your work. Mở từng thẻ khi cần; sau đó nhìn đi chỗ khác và nói lại.","items":[{"label":"1/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"We've completed…","meaning":"Chúng tôi đã hoàn thành…","details":["Report completed work that matters now.","We've completed + noun","We've completed the main screens.","We've completed the first round of testing."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-1"},{"label":"2/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"So far, we've…","meaning":"Tính đến hiện tại, chúng tôi đã…","details":["Summarize progress up to now.","So far, we've + past participle","So far, we've fixed two bugs.","So far, we've tested all the main screens."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-2"},{"label":"3/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"We're on track","meaning":"Chúng tôi đang đúng tiến độ","details":["Say that work is progressing according to plan.","We're on track + optional to + verb","We're on track.","We're on track to release the app on Friday."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-3"},{"label":"4/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"We still need to…","meaning":"Chúng tôi vẫn cần…","details":["Name work that remains unfinished.","We still need to + base verb","We still need to test it.","We still need to fix three small bugs."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-4"},{"label":"5/5 · Luyện hôm nay","phrase":"The next step is…","meaning":"Bước tiếp theo là…","details":["Explain what should happen next.","The next step is to + base verb","The next step is to test it.","The next step is to share the app with a small group."],"saveKey":"chunk-v1-used-5"}]},{"id":"variation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">VARIATION · 4 MIN</span><h2>Change it, then make it yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Say each answer first, then type a short sentence. Two quick variations per chunk; keep the same pattern.</p><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>1. We've completed…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\">A. Use this idea: the new help page.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>2. So far, we've…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\">A. Use this idea: write three help articles.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>3. We're on track</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\">A. Use this idea: finish the report tomorrow.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>4. We still need to…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\">A. Use this idea: prepare the store description.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>5. The next step is…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\">A. Use this idea: ask the client for feedback.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\"></div>"},{"id":"rapid-recall","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">RAPID RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Recall in about three seconds</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Look away from the chunk cards. Try to start speaking within 3 seconds, then type what you said. A model appears only after an attempt; other natural answers are possible.</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Report completed work that matters now. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We've completed the first round of testing.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Summarize progress up to now. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"So far, we've tested all the main screens.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Say that work is progressing according to plan. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We're on track to release the app on Friday.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Name work that remains unfinished. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We still need to fix three small bugs.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Explain what should happen next. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"The next step is to share the app with a small group.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Express confidence about an outcome. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I'm confident that the new help page will be useful.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"},{"id":"speaking","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">SPEAK · 5 MIN</span><h2>Make the language yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read aloud three times. Follow the pauses marked by / and emphasize the important words.</p><div class=\"shadow\">We've completed the main screens. /<br>So far, we've fixed two bugs. /<br>We're on track.</div><p><b>Speaking challenge:</b> Give a clear progress update and next steps.</p><p class=\"instruction\">Speak for 120 seconds. Use at least 3 chunks. Notes only: your situation · two details · a reason or problem · your next step. Do not write a full script first.</p><textarea id=\"speaking-response\" data-save=\"speaking\" placeholder=\"Nói thành tiếng trước, rồi nhập lại ít nhất 8 từ bạn đã nói…\"></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"speaking-done\">Tôi đã nói thành tiếng</button><span id=\"status-speaking\">Chưa hoàn thành</span></div><div id=\"speak-feedback\" class=\"feedback\"></div>"},{"id":"conversation","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What did you finish recently?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>What happened during the work?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>What did you learn?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What are you planning next?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"},{"id":"quiz","className":"panel","type":"assessment","prefix":"quiz","label":"END CHECK · 2 MIN","heading":"Choose a useful chunk","hint":"Think about the situation where you would use the phrase.","questions":[{"prompt":"1. Report completed work that matters now.","choices":[{"text":" We've completed…","name":"quiz-1","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"},{"text":" We still need to…","name":"quiz-1","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz1"}]},{"prompt":"2. Explain what should happen next.","choices":[{"text":" So far, we've…","name":"quiz-2","value":"a","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"},{"text":" The next step is…","name":"quiz-2","value":"b","saveKey":"v2-quiz2"}]}]},{"id":"daily-progress","className":"panel","type":"rich","html":"<span class=\"number\">REVIEW · 2 MIN</span><h2>Today's progress</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Các số về nói và nhớ chunk là tự đánh giá; số câu đọc hiểu lấy từ lần nộp gần nhất. Chưa nhập nghĩa là chưa có dữ liệu.</p><p id=\"chunk-progress\" role=\"status\"></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-seconds\">Actual speaking time (seconds):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-improvement\">One thing I can do better now:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-improvement\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-improvement\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-next\">Tomorrow, one small thing I will practise:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-next\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-next\">"}],"completionText":"Hoàn thành đọc hiểu, kể lần một, quiz và các bước Recall → Think → đối chiếu → kể lần hai. Nhiều bài trong cùng ngày chỉ tính một ngày streak.","navigation":[{"href":"../index.html","text":"← Dashboard"},{"href":"day-28.html","text":"Day 28 →"}]},"pageType":"lesson"},"__N_SSG":true}